<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Troubleshooting - 标签 - 蜷缩的蜗牛</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/tags/troubleshooting/</link><description>云原生时代运维</description><generator>Hugo 0.147.7 &amp; FixIt v0.4.0-alpha.2-20251022034748-fe129dd2</generator><language>zh-CN</language><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 17:45:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.kbsonlong.com/tags/troubleshooting/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kubernetes Node Exporter Down 告警排查实战：隐形杀手 processes 采集器</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/k8s-node-exporter-down-troubleshooting-processes-collector/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 17:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/k8s-node-exporter-down-troubleshooting-processes-collector/</guid><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/kubernetes/">Kubernetes</category><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/observability/">Observability</category><description>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>摘要&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>告警现象&lt;/strong>: 核心 OLAP 节点 Node Exporter Down，日志报 &lt;code>broken pipe&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>排查路径&lt;/strong>: 从网络连通性验证到具体采集器性能分析，逐步缩小范围。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>根因定位&lt;/strong>: &lt;code>processes&lt;/code> 采集器在遍历海量进程时耗时过长（&amp;gt;30s），导致抓取超时。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>解决方案&lt;/strong>: 禁用高开销采集器，恢复监控稳定性。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>&lt;/blockquote></description></item><item><title>Harbor 连接 PostgreSQL 报错 SQLSTATE XX000 排查指南</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/harbor-postgres-connection-error-xx000/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 17:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/harbor-postgres-connection-error-xx000/</guid><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/harbor/">Harbor</category><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5/">故障排查</category><description>&lt;p>在维护 Harbor 镜像仓库时，我们可能会遇到 Harbor 核心服务无法连接数据库的情况，导致无法推送镜像或查看项目。本文将针对一个特定的 PostgreSQL 连接错误进行排查分析。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>解决 Harbor 推送 S3 报错 412 Precondition Failed</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/harbor-s3-412-precondition-failed/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/harbor-s3-412-precondition-failed/</guid><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/harbor/">Harbor</category><description>&lt;p>在云原生环境中，使用 Harbor 对接对象存储（如 AWS S3、MinIO、Ceph RGW、Aliyun OSS 等）是常见的做法。然而，在推送大镜像时，有时会遇到 &lt;code>412 Precondition Failed&lt;/code> 错误，导致推送失败。本文将详细分析该问题的原因并提供解决方案。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Linux 性能分析：60,000 毫秒速查</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/linux-performance-analysis-in-60000-milliseconds/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/linux-performance-analysis-in-60000-milliseconds/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="linux-性能分析60000-毫秒速查">&lt;span>Linux 性能分析：60,000 毫秒速查&lt;/span>
